[{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0007","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-10141","title":"Xdebug 远程调试 OS 命令注入漏洞","description":"Xdebug（PHP 调试扩展）2.5.5 及更早版本中存在未经身份认证的 OS 命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。当启用远程调试功能时，Xdebug 在 9000 端口监听调试器协议命令且未实施任何身份验证机制，远程攻击者无需任何凭证即可向该接口发送特制的 eval 命令，执行任意 PHP 代码，进而调用 system()、passthru() 等系统级函数，在 Web 服务器用户权限下完全控制目标主机。该漏洞影响所有启用远程调试的 Xdebug 2.5.5 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-10141"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2025-07-23T14:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:21:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Xdebug 至 3.x 系列最新版本（当前最新为 3.5.3），或至少升级至 2.5.6 及以上版本。在生产环境中必须将 php.ini 中 `xdebug.remote_enable` 设为 `Off`，并确保 `xdebug.remote_connect_back` 为 `Off`。如确需远程调试功能，通过防火墙（iptables/ufw）限制端口 9000 仅允许受信 IP 访问，禁止对公网开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://web.archive.org/web/20231226215418/https://paper.seebug.org/397/","https://kirtixs.com/blog/2015/11/13/xpwn-exploiting-xdebug-enabled-servers/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44568","https://www.fortiguard.com/encyclopedia/ips/46000","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/xdebug-remote-debugger-unauth-os-command-execution","https://xdebug.org/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-10141.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-10141.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2015/CVE-2015-10141.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-10141.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/178bcb396ea0966e2a6aefa308b23c11593087fc/data/2015/CVE-2015-10141-D3Ext_CVE-2015-10141.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-10141.rules","https://github.com/D3Ext/CVE-2015-10141/blob/4c4305a29b66d27d6514bb6e771eefb4b4358ce8/CVE-2015-10141.py","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2015/UBUNTU-CVE-2015-10141.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-10141_2.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2015/CVE-2015-10141.md","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-10141.yaml","https://github.com/D3Ext/CVE-2015-10141","https://github.com/K3ysTr0K3R/CVE-2015-10141","https://github.com/n0m4d22/PoC-CVE-2015-10141-Xdebug"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0013","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-20067","title":"WordPress WP Attachment Export 插件授权机制缺失漏洞","description":"WordPress WP Attachment Export 插件（版本低于 0.2.4）存在授权机制缺失漏洞（CWE-862）。该插件在导出附件/文章 XML 数据时未对用户身份进行有效验证，导致未经认证的远程攻击者可直接通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求访问导出接口，下载包含所有附件及文章详细信息的 XML 文件，造成敏感信息泄露。攻击者无需任何权限或用户交互，仅需网络访问即可利用该漏洞。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-20067"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2021-11-01T09:15:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:23:23Z","remediation":"立即将 WP Attachment Export 插件升级至 0.2.4 或更高版本，该版本已添加权限检查，阻止未认证用户下载附件 XML 数据。如无法立即升级，可临时在 WordPress 网站根目录的 .htaccess 或 Nginx 配置中添加规则，阻止对 `/wp-content/plugins/wp-attachment-export/` 目录的匿名访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/espreto/wpsploit/blob/master/modules/auxiliary/scanner/http/wp_attachment_export_file_download.rb","https://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2015/Jul/73","https://wpscan.com/vulnerability/d1a9ed65-baf3-4c85-b077-1f37d8c7793a","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-20067.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-20067.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-20067.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2015/20xxx/CVE-2015-20067.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-20067.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-20067_2.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2015-20067.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8ffd5cee3de3f658d05892b1bd520deca0bdcfb2/2015/CVE-2015-20067.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ad32beb8a6ecc99ff5b9401392fe4eb738c13e96/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-200xx/CVE-2015-20067.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-20067_3.yaml","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/2f3c8464ecb7e7fdc3b1076605ef127bac54ce3e/advisories/2022/05/EUVD-2015-2108.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0071","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-9499","title":"WordPress Showbiz Pro插件任意文件上传远程代码执行漏洞","description":"WordPress Showbiz Pro 插件存在任意文件上传漏洞，该插件在处理 ZIP 压缩包上传时未对文件类型进行有效验证，导致攻击者可构造包含恶意 PHP 文件的 ZIP 压缩包并上传至服务器。当服务器解压该压缩包后，恶意 PHP 文件将被释放到 Web 可访问目录，攻击者可直接访问该文件实现远程代码执行，从而完全控制受影响的 WordPress 站点。该漏洞影响 1.7.1 及以下所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需具备文件上传功能的访问权限即可利用此漏洞，最终可能导致网站数据泄露、恶意代码植入、服务器被完全接管等严重后果。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-9499"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-10-22T21:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:36:39Z","remediation":"立即禁用并完全删除 WordPress Showbiz Pro 插件（当前最高版本 1.7.1 仍未修复该漏洞，开发商未发布补丁）。操作步骤：1）登录 WordPress 后台进入\"插件\"页面，停用 Showbiz Pro；2）点击\"删除\"移除插件文件；3）手动清理 wp-content/plugins/showbizpro/ 目录及 wp-content/uploads/ 下残留的临时上传文件（如 temp/update_extract/ 路径中的 PHP 文件）；4）检查数据库 wp_options 表中是否存在该插件相关配置并清除；5）通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）添加规则拦截对 wp-admin/admin-ajax.php 中 action=showbiz_ajax_action 的请求作为临时缓解措施；6）如确需类似功能，可替换为官方维护的同类轮播插件（如 MetaSlider、Smart Slider 3 等）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/espreto/wpsploit/blob/master/modules/exploits/unix/webapp/wp_showbiz_file_upload.rb","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/7955","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35385","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9499.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-9499.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9499.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2015/9xxx/CVE-2015-9499.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-9499.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-9499-0d6f2342140d70176371132706e36660.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-9499_3.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2015-9499.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9499.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/67be355b2024cf650191c9c4ccd0c55290fa0eef/2015/CVE-2015-9499.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2015-9499.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0071.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0070","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0070.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-9480","title":"WordPress RobotCPA插件路径遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress RobotCPA 插件 5 版本中存在路径遍历漏洞，位于 f.php 文件的 l 参数中。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用 l 参数中的目录跳转序列（如 ../）读取服务器上任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响所有使用 RobotCPA 插件的 WordPress 站点，攻击无需任何权限，利用难度低，危害等级高。建议用户立即升级或移除受影响插件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-9480"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-10-10T17:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:36:36Z","remediation":"立即在 WordPress 后台「插件」页面停用并彻底删除 RobotCPA 插件，该插件已长期无人维护且官方未发布补丁。如仍需广告跟踪功能，替换为活跃维护的替代插件（如 Pretty Links）。同时确保 WordPress 核心程序及所有插件更新至最新版本，并配置 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截路径遍历攻击载荷（如 `../` 及编码变体）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37252","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9480.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-9480.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9480.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-9480/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-9480.py","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2015-9480_1_3.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2015-9480-2629.yaml","https://github.com/khulnasoft-bot/OSVIC/blob/a4eeee61d1cb6e29519