3f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-9415.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9415.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2015/9xxx/CVE-2015-9415.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-9415.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-9415-a268a45953d986374eff621a239a7b86.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-9415.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2015-9415.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9415.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2015/CVE-2015-9415-bj_lazy_load-022f6239-67f2-4680-aeed-34c98c953bea.yaml","https://github.com/b1ank1108/VulSentinel/blob/65dd96623246c3767e98237d690efc4c56ec7044/reports/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9415.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0069.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0068","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-9414","title":"WordPress wp-symposium 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 wp-symposium 插件 15.8.1 及之前版本中存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞（CWE-79），该漏洞位于 `get_album_item.php` 文件中，由于对 `size` 参数缺乏充分的过滤与转义处理，攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL 诱使用户点击，从而在目标浏览器中执行任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 代码。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互。成功利用可导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或钓鱼攻击。建议升级至最新版本或删除该插件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2015-9414"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-26T00:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:36:28Z","remediation":"该插件已于 2015 年 9 月 11 日从 WordPress 官方仓库下架关闭，不再维护更新。建议立即卸载并删除 wp-symposium 插件，替换为其他仍在维护的社区/论坛插件。如因业务依赖暂时无法卸载，可手动编辑 get_album_item.php 文件，对 $_GET['size'] 参数添加 htmlspecialchars() 转义处理，并在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面拦截包含恶意脚本的 size 参数请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-symposium/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8175","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9414.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-9414.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9414.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-9414/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-9414.py","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/cve-2015-9414-2626.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-9414-4f1eacae614b355883f19ec1f1569210.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2015-9414-2628.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-9414_6.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2015-9414.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2015/9xxx/CVE-2015-9414.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2015-9414-2625.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0067","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-9406","title":"WordPress mTheme-Unus theme 路径遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress mTheme-Unus 主题 2.3 版本之前存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 css/css.php 文件的 files 参数传入 `..`（点点）序列进行路径遍历，从而读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响机密性，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议用户升级至 mTheme-Unus 主题 2.3 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-9406"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-20T20:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:36:27Z","remediation":"将 WordPress mTheme-Unus 主题升级至 2.3 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可删除或重命名 css/css.php 文件中的 files 参数处理逻辑，或在 Web 服务器层面（如 Nginx/Apache）添加规则阻止包含 .. 的路径请求。同时建议检查服务器上是否已有被读取的敏感文件泄露。该主题已停止官方维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的主题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/133778/","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9890","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9406.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-9406.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9406.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2015/9xxx/CVE-2015-9406.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-9406.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-9406_9.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-9406.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2015-9406.yaml","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-9406_3.yaml","https://github.com/b1ank1108/VulSentinel/blob/65dd96623246c3767e98237d690efc4c56ec7044/reports/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9406.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0065","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-9323","title":"WordPress 404-to-301插件SQL注入漏洞","description":"WordPress 404-to-301 插件 2.0.3 之前版本存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标 WordPress 站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用插件对 404 错误页面跳转记录功能中未正确过滤的输入参数，注入恶意 SQL 语句。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，成功利用后可导致数据库信息泄露、数据篡改甚至完全控制目标站点。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。建议升级至 2.0.3 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-9323"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-16T21:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:36:17Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 404-to-301 插件升级至 2.0.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复未授权 SQL 注入漏洞。如无法立即升级，可暂时禁用该插件，并在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则拦截包含恶意 SQL 关键字的 404 请求路径作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Hacker5preme/Exploits/tree/main/Wordpress/CVE-2015-9323","https://wordpress.org/plugins/404-to-301/#developers","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/50698","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9323.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-9323.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9323.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2015/9xxx/CVE-2015-9323.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-9323/vultarget/README.md","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2015-9323_5.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2015/CVE-2015-9323.json","https://github.com/Hacker5preme/Exploits/blob/2d04e08775ba83cb74599f5d23269288d849deac/Wordpress/CVE-2015-9323/README.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2015-9323.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2015-9323.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idsqli"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0065.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0064","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-9312","title":"WordPress newstatpress插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress NewStatPress 插件 1.0.5 之前版本中存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞。该漏洞位于 includes/nsp_search.php 文件的第 28 行和第 31 行，程序直接从 $_GET 参数中获取数据并输出到页面，未进行任何过滤或转义处理。虽然 WordPress 会自动对引号内的输出进行转义，但此处输出位于引号之外，导致攻击者可以注入任意 HTML 和 JavaScript 代码。攻击者需要诱使已登录的管理员用户访问特制的 URL，通过 groupby1 参数注入恶意 payload，从而在管理后台上下文中执行任意脚本代码，可能导致会话劫持、页面篡改或敏感信息窃取。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危，建议升级至 1.0.6 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2015-9312"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-14T15:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:36:16Z","remediation":"将 WordPress newstatpress 插件升级到 1.0.5 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 WordPress 后台禁用 newstatpress 插件，并启用 WordPress 内置的安全插件（如 Wordfence）对输入输出进行 XSS 过滤防护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/newstatpress/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9312.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-9312.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-9312.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2015/9xxx/CVE-2015-9312.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-9312.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-9312-27e9e3419396fca6a5f9962f08aa4562.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-9312.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/CVE-2015-9312.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2d169092e150510565286f993df9f7fc48f36f74/2015/CVE-2015-9312.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2015-9312.yaml","https://github.com/303donatello/CVE-Everyday/blob/c4d8c1b2c636afd0cd475fef2dfe0051ec449e70/CVE-2019.8.10-8.15.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0039","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-4632","title":"Koha 3.20.1 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Koha 开源图书馆管理系统 3.14.x 至 3.20.1 版本存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22），远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 `/cgi-bin/koha/svc/virtualshelves/search` 或 `/cgi-bin/koha/svc/members/search` 接口的 `template_path` 参数中注入 `..%2f`（URL 编码的路径穿越序列）绕过目录访问限制，实现读取服务器上任意文件，导致敏感配置信息和数据库凭证泄露。受影响的版本包括 3.14.16 之前、3.16.12 之前、3.18.08 之前及 3.20.1 之前的所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2015-4632"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2018-10-19T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Koha 升级至 3.14.16、3.16.12、3.18.08 或 3.20.1 及以上版本。如无法升级，在 